## Automation attempts now tell you why they were skipped or failed

[`GET /v1/subscribers/{id_or_email}/automations`](/api-subscribers-automations) now returns a read-only `error` code on each attempt. See [automation attempt errors](/api-automation-attempt-error) for the possible values.

The field is `null` when the attempt succeeded, hasn't run yet, or was [skipped manually](/api-subscribers-automations-update).
